From: Hardened NanoKVM security maintenance
Subject: [PATCH] package/hostapd: disable unused IEEE 802.11be support

The generated NanoKVM access point configuration only enables 802.11n. Avoid
compiling the unused 802.11be/MLO parser and its associated attack surface.

diff --git a/package/hostapd/hostapd.mk b/package/hostapd/hostapd.mk
--- a/package/hostapd/hostapd.mk
+++ b/package/hostapd/hostapd.mk
@@ -56 +55,0 @@ HOSTAPD_CONFIG_ENABLE += \
-	CONFIG_IEEE80211BE \
